These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on May 26, 2026

= May 26, 2026 =

= Hotfix =

* Dark Assassin in Feerrott should now give XP.
* Amplification (Bard Song) will no longer be affected by any singing mods, including itself.
* Updated Plane of Sky quests one more time, to use a set of Wind Runes, instead of class specific runes.
* Also updated the usable classes on old, and new, PoSky items, they should be correct now! If not, lodge a formal complaint at the nearest booth.
* Each quest within a class will use a different wind rune, so be sure to stock up!
* Naggy raid instance zone-in point moved slightly to avoid some races getting stuck in the wall.
* Point blank AOE spells will now hit a maximum of 8 targets.
* Players will no longer spawn facing the zone exit when entering a personal instance of Befallen
* Adjusted some backend server configuration settings for performance.